#ASSERT `Art 77(1) as amended the national public authority or body has the power to request and access any information or documentation created or maintained from the relevant market surveillance authority pursuant to this Regulation` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 77(1) as amended the national public authority or body has the power to request and access any information or documentation created or maintained from the relevant market surveillance authority pursuant to this Regulation` FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
