#ASSERT `Art 77(2) first sentence the date by which each Member State must identify the authorities and make the list publicly available`  EQUALS Date 2 11 2024
#ASSERT `Art 77(2) the date by which each Member State must identify the authorities and make the list publicly available on the date asked` `Art 77 test on` EQUALS JUST (Date 2 11 2024)
#ASSERT `Art 77(2) the date by which each Member State must identify the authorities and make the list publicly available on the date asked` `Art 77 test before` EQUALS NOTHING
-- the text's own date, 2 November 2024
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 77(2) first sentence the Member State's duty to identify the authorities and make the list publicly available` `Art 77 test on` AT (Day (Date 1 8 2024)) WITH
    PARTY `Arts 72 to 79 party Member State` DOES `Art 77(2) identify the public authorities or bodies referred to in paragraph 1 and make a list of them publicly available` AT (Day (Date 2 11 2024))
-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `Art 77(2) first sentence the Member State's duty to identify the authorities and make the list publicly available` `Art 77 test on` AT (Day (Date 1 8 2024)) WITH
    PARTY `Arts 72 to 79 party Member State` DOES `Art 77(2) identify the public authorities or bodies referred to in paragraph 1 and make a list of them publicly available` AT (Day (Date 3 11 2024))
-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `Art 77(2) first sentence the Member State's duty to identify the authorities and make the list publicly available` `Art 77 test on` AT (Day (Date 1 8 2024)) WITH
    WAITUNTIL (Day (Date 3 11 2024))
